{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y的感受提示有时过密，尤其纵向交替的段落，观众可能来不及兼顾话语和音乐；X的左右分栏更容易快速扫读。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y虽然视觉信息更密，但【】突出人物每一阶段的心理关节，而分时出现的感受词能让观众把音乐变化和人物心境对应起来，不必一次读完所有文字。尤其反复出现的【被当作自己人】，把怀念、孤独、犹豫和最后的接纳串成了一条清晰的情感线；X的叙述更顺口、分栏更好扫，但部分音乐感受被压缩成概括性短词，人物内心变化与具体音乐细节之间的联系没有Y那么充分。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8815bfef-a21b-41df-ad68-55f4fa04a6da", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T000544970605Z", "elapsed_seconds": 71.453, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:06:56.427211+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "82a138767e0443b6cd8c03b6dbbae4e74d1c34bb6c6f13a0742b909be7dce367", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.p